WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.850
It's from morning to night!

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.650
Oh no! Next!

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.110
1, 2, 3, 4, 5!  A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.190
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.610
Yoohoo!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.740
Yay! Yay!

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.280
Yahoo!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.990
Let's go!

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.580
*gobble gobble*

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.120
*tip tap*

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.910
*huff puff*

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.210
Alright! I'm all full from breakfast!

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.380
Gather everyone and let's go to school!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.590
Monday makes me sleepy

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.670
I'll feign sick and it'll be Sunday!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.970
Yeah! We've got field trips and sports days!

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.090
I'm so excited that I couldn't sleep!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.260
There's a storm and typhoon warning!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.640
It will be pushed back five days!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.980
Tests?! No way! I don't want them!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:48.400
I can't escape! My mind and answer sheet are both blank!

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.740
Let's nap in the infirmary!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.820
Yes! Food time! Three servings of curry rice!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.990
More! More! I want more!

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.240
My body's growing, so is my appetite!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.370
1, 2, 3 and GO!

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.540
I'm all ready!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.420
Let's start our awesome day today!

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.090
I can't stop myself! I won't stop myself!

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.300
Let's all go wild!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.630
Extraterritoriality? What's that?

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.930
I'm an elementary schooler!

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:23.180
It's autumn and winter!

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.350
They're great! Next!

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.020
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.450
What are you making?

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.030
I put together a slide out of extra wood slats!

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.450
Wanna try?

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:50.630
J-Just once before the boys get here.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.010
Yahoo!

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:04.180
That feels pretty good!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:12.360
My swimsuit got torn near my butt!

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.650
T-Them too?

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.910
Hey, so...

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:20.950
W-What is it?

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:21.950
Wait.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:24.740
If hers isn't torn, I'll just embarrass myself!

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:27.790
Not much, just that your hair's a mess!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.750
Shut up!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.500
I can't say it.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.420
I'm gonna slide down on my belly!

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.880
Don't!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.670
Futaba, what is this?

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:39.930
A slide?

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:44.260
Stupid boys, just slide down without knowing a thing!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.140
How can you even have fun with this thing?

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.140
You're such a kid, Futaba.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.900
It's getting even harder to say it...

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.150
This hole... I can't hide it with just my hands.

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.910
I need something bigger...

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:07.240
My life-board!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.710
Oh right! The kickboard!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.050
What are you doing?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.670
It's a new swimming style!

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.050
We have some time left, so let's play a game collecting rubber balls.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.390
Whoever collects the most wins!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.720
Yay!

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.350
Now he's started a stupid game!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:38.690
What'd you do that for?!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:43.240
You were trying to drink the water around me, weren't you? Sicko!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.660
I was just trying to pick up a ball!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:49.160
Who'd want to drink that high-cholesterol soup?!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.620
What did you say?!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.250
Oh, a ball.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.960
Right! I can use my leg to pick up the...

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.220
My leg!

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.090
M-Mitsuba!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.140
W-We need to save her!

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:07.430
But...

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.350
our butts...!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:16.520
I'm going to die with my butt showing!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.570
Yabecchi! Mitsuba is drowning!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.900
Mitsuba!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.490
You guys...

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.950
You've got holes in your butts!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.080
Shut up! Laugh all you want!!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.250
T-This is this year's new look!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:42.630
No way that's a new look! Idiots! Sickos!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.470
What a jerk!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.020
I called you all to my house today for none other than this.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.440
It feels like something serious...

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.060
You're gonna treat me to dessert, right?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.190
First, I want you to see this.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.450
You perverted bouncy hair girl!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.710
That's not it! Look carefully at the open locker!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.750
When you adjust the brightness...

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.710
It's a face!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.340
It's a paranormal photograph!

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.220
It's just the light!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.180
She's right! There's no such thing as a ghost!

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.970
It's definitely Hitoha!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:34.060
Hitoha must've been hiding in the locker!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.890
That's even scarier! Rude too.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.520
It's just the shadow of the things inside!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:45.610
But just look! You can find the same face in any of these photos with Mitsuba in them!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.530
I can see you're all shaking in your boots.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:53.490
Yeah... from just how many secret pictures you took of Mitsuba.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.920
Bad things keep happening to Mitsuba because she's being haunted by ghosts!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.380
You're right. Something bad is happening right now.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.500
You're fated to have nothing but misfortune your whole life!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.670
Hmph! Ghosts are just rubbish!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.800
If there's no dessert, I'm going home.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.850
Why the heck is there a mop here?!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.140
Did you see that just now?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.350
She completely lost it over a faked picture!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.690
Faked?

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.860
I knew they were fake.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:28.900
From now on we'll get to see Mitsuba be terrified of ghosts every time something bad happens to her!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.070
And, of course, I got it all on tape.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:34.160
You have way too much free time.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.660
How did you fake those photos?

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:40.460
It's a piece of cake! Just copy over someone else's face-

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.500
Did someone say "paranormal photograph"?!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.460
I ran into her in front of your house just now.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:47.800
Sakiko...

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.720
Oh man. I knew she'd come.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:54.810
My dowsing rods had a strong reaction in front of Sugi's house.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.810
There's definitely a load of money here!

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.350
She's not a bourgeois for nothing.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.810
That aside, where's the paranormal photograph?

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.310
Oh right!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:05.110
Mitsuba! Why don't you get Matsuoka to perform an exorcism for you?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.440
...with your whole body covered with prayers or something.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.570
Wai- What are you doing?!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.490
We have to have a ceremony and burn it!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.410
You can buy however many computers you want, right?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.580
Why not just delete the data?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:22.330
No way! It's got all my photos on it!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:26.090
She's worried about the pictures of Mitsuba more than the actual computer...

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:35.260
I know! Let's get some opinions from some priests or psychics!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.970
A-Ah, yeah.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.140
If it's a real person, she won't have to burn it!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.890
Wait a minute!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.690
There are even shots of me in my panties and changing clothes!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.650
If some pervert sees them, what are you gonna do about it?!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:49.780
It won't happen.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.240
Sakiko!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:57.030
No worries. If it's the beautiful girl genius exorcist Hitoha, you'll be fine, right?

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.160
Hey you, since when were you "beautiful"?

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.790
That's the first thing you noticed?!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.620
This way, Hitoha.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.790
C'mere a sec.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:11.800
Even if it's a small ghost, just say it's something terribly evil!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:15.720
Then her computer will end up in flames along with all the photos!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.850
I see a terribly evil woman.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.020
C'mere a sec!

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.600
Just say it's a small ghost that doesn't need a ceremony...

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:30.570
but that it'll bring misfortune to the one it's haunting.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.570
I sense a whimsical spirit.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:34.990
What do you think?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.330
She's sneaking food!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:42.580
This isn't something that needs a-

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:47.420
Wait! Don't look at me! Look at the ghost! Here!

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.670
I-Isn't this me?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.770
All of these have my face on them.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:08.940
It's a terribly evil spirit! We'll have to hold a service immediately!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.820
She recognized herself after all!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.610
Dooooon't!!

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:14.740
Hold on a sec.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.120
Here.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:24.620
Just like you said, it's really Hitoha. Yoshioka, you were right.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:32.300
Mitsuba, I just sent that photo of you sneaking food to Papa's phone.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:38.260
Mitsuba! I don't remember raising you to sneak food.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.310
Maybe I'm just tired after all.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.200
Yay!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.660
Shin! Chiba!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:03.830
Thanks for waiting~

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.250
Grilled Squid!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.580
Let's get some!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.710
It's good!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:13.800
Don't get too excited and dirty your yukata.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.590
This is good!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.760
Hitoha, aren't you going to have one?

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:20.970
No thanks.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.850
Bugs might've been on them.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.140
Whatever!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:37.530
Hitoha, is it true that girls don't wear panties underneath yukatas?

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.570
That's just a myth.

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:41.990
N-No way!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.160
Shin, what's up?

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.830
Ah, eh, what?

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.670
You look down.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.210
Is it because you haven't finished your summer homework?

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.710
I'm not like you. Really, it's nothing.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.970
Let's do some goldfish scooping!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.890
Remember, we've got a cat, so we can't keep any!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.560
We can use them as bait to catch crayfish!

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.390
Bait...

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.980
Shin, you in?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.860
Shin!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.650
Eh, ah, no, I'm good.

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.410
Why is Shin so down today?

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.990
How am I supposed to know?

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.410
No one cares about that pervert anyway.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.830
Pervert...

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.540
That's it!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.210
Shin!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.050
Let's do the yo-yo fishing!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.970
Nah, it's too childish.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.020
Shin!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.100
Let's get a mask!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.770
Let's play ring toss!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.860
Here we go!

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.360
Now you're throwing that?

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.910
Isn't this fun?

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.910
No, not at all.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.500
I knew mine weren't good enough for you!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.500
N-No! It's not about whose they are!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.010
What kind of panties does Shin like?

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.510
Well, it's definitely not Mitsuba's.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.140
What was that?!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.260
Maybe, cute, erotic panties.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.470
Oh, Mitsuba! Guys!

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:32.980
Why hello, Mitsuba! You like a 5-year-old on her way to a shrine-

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.150
Shin!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.530
Here, here!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.780
Whose are those?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.660
It's nothing. so just quit bothering me.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.490
Shin!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.250
You've got a really high fever!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.130
Why didn't you tell me you weren't feeling well?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:04.130
Because... I couldn't play the whole vacation with all the summer school.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:07.260
So I wanted to come to the festival no matter what.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.720
Shin, you're still such a kid!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.390
S-Shut up!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.650
Shin?

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.150
That's it!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.910
Oh, you're back early.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.160
Ma'am, Shin is...

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.670
Wai- Mom?!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.840
I don't know a pervert like you!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.210
Don't lock me out!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.300
Open up, open up!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.760
Why?! Why are you doing this?!

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.720
I hope the panties help Shin's fever go down soon.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.220
Mom, why?!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.230
Hey, Satou! Let's do flips on the bar!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.860
I'll spot you.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.360
What? I can do it myself.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.320
C'mon, just do it.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.490
Here I go.

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.500
It's complete!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.000
My secret move no. 3:

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.130
Bar Flip Top Turnover!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.380
I'm not your guinea pig!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:31.600
But this move can only be used in really limited situations.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.600
Secret move no. 1, Light-Speed Panty Dropper!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.930
Secret move no. 2...

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.390
Light-Speed Bra Unhooker!

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.810
Actually, the moves are getting less ambitious.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.070
Out of ideas?

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.280
Satou, listen.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:49.820
I'm not really interested in seeing our classmates' bodies.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:53.410
I just want to see them embarrassed.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:57.700
Troubling women is a man's duty.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.710
What are you guys doing?

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.040
I'm helping Satou practice bar flips.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.170
I said I can do it myself!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.720
Which of you can't do a bar flip?

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.260
You too, right?!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.810
All right! I'll help the three-

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.270
Then I'll help you out!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:21.480
Shut up! You're way too strong! You might kill them!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.650
Whatever. Let's go play soccer over there.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.320
Okay then, I'll help you.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.360
Shut your trap!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:35.200
We all know you have a criminal record, you perverted idiot!

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.370
I'm not a pervert or an idiot!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.080
Wait! Hey!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:43.080
Aren't you embarrassed that you can't do a bar flip?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.920
You're already in sixth grade!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.590
I-I can do it if I try!

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:53.970
Okay.

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:55.930
H-Heavy!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.810
Hey, bend your arms! You can do it!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.350
I can't take this! Let go!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.900
Idiot! Don't give up!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.520
I'm trying hard here too!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.940
You can do it!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.530
Heave-ho!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.660
You did it!

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.790
Of course I can do this much!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.660
Man oh man.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.370
The move!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.330
"The move"?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.880
Well, never mind.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.090
I'm not expecting anything with a chest like yours.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.340
What?!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.800
Hitoha, wait up!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:37.180
Hitoha's dressed in a one piece!

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:40.140
That means she'll be just in her panties turned over her dress!

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.060
It's killing two birds with one stone!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.020
Umm, what about me?

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.310
You come later.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:48.570
Why? Because you like Hitoha more?

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.070
Hitoha! Please try a bar flip.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.440
It's meaningless.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:56.950
Not at all! It feels really great to spin round in midair!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:00.870
Right, Mitsuba? Didn't my technique feel good?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.870
It's because I tried hard!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:06.540
Hitoha, just take Chiba's advice!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.880
I strongly refuse.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.380
Don't butt in and ruin it, eyebrows!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.090
There, there.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:17.640
Right! Didn't Gachi Ranger say it, too?

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.720
If you run away from the things you can't do, you won't be able to do anything!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:25.980
People who strive towards their goals are seriously beautiful!

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.980
J-Just once, then.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:32.570
Yay! I love Gachi Rangers!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:35.320
Do your best!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.660
I'll put everything into this attack!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.580
I'm one who lives for erotica.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.330
One who devotes my life to that alone,

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.500
Chiba Yuudai!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.090
What?!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.840
Not panties, but bloomers?!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:56.420
The top?!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:02.180
What the hell?!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.730
That Gachi belt's great!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.900
The Gachi Rangers protected what was important!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.440
Yeah.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.610
Don't mess with me!!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.820
I executed it perfectly...

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:16.610
My secret move, Bar Flip Top Turnover!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.780
Screw Gachi Rangers!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.380
I didn't see anything so don't get so angry!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.960
Ouch! That hurts!

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:43.260
I'll teach you so that you'll be able to swim a little by the second semester!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.560
I'm fine not being able to swim.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:49.560
Look! Just imagine you're grabbing the wat-

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.480
Hey! No swimming over there!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:57.440
Slide! I wanna ride it!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.530
Hey you!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:13.000
Swimming is pointless.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.840
Mitsuba!

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.300
Why are you here?

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:21.180
Papa's friends with the mayor, so I can come here for free anytime!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.760
Mayor what? I bet he reeks of corruption.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.510
Then get out of this town right now!

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.640
Get out of Japan right now!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.190
I've blown up the rubber ring so let's go-

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.020
No.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.110
We'll float like that, and it won't be scary, so let's both-

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.440
Over my dead body.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:40.650
If you run away from the things you can't do, you won't be able to do anything!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.200
Stop it. Let go of me.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.660
Excuse me, mister.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.330
No, you're mistaken!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.660
Ah, wait!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:53.920
Maybe getting away from all the noise...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:57.670
and just drifting down the stream alone isn't too bad.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.850
Hitoha!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.470
Yahoo!

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.060
Annoying.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.660
Ah! From the impact just now...!

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.920
Futaba, Futaba! Where is she?!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.170
Oh my, it's pretty deep here!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.630
Wai- Hey!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.340
No, I'm dead. I'm going to die.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:55.310
Farewell, Nipples, Cat.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.230
Farewell, Gachi Rangers.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.480
Oh, family too.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:26.760
Don't do the butterfly stroke in the floating pool!

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:34.480
The water spraying on me... The gentle resistance of the water...

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:38.310
The wind... They feel great!

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.650
That was a good swim!

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:47.200
Swimming feels good!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:48.910
Yeah.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:53.580
Maybe I should learn to swim a little.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:54.750
Really?!

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.790
Let's do our best so we can swim to Hawaii together!

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:02.250
That's impossible.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:06.260
Put your thumb in first!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:09.550
No, no, stretch your hands out more.

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:12.600
Right, and like this.

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:14.890
And like this!

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:17.190
Like this.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:24.030
I knew it... Swimming is a pointless activity.

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:52.940
Nearer, my God, to Thee, nearer to Thee!

00:22:53.020 --> 00:23:06.990
E'en though it be a cross that raiseth me;

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:21.380
Still all my song shall be nearer, my God, to Thee,

00:23:21.380 --> 00:23:39.900
Nearer, my God, to Thee, nearer to Thee!

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:51.120
Amen.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:55.070
Don't make it look like I'm dead!

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:59.000
Shin and his mom have similar voices!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:00.200
That's because they're mother and child.

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:03.140
That's not true for us, though.

00:24:03.140 --> 00:24:04.960
Of course it is!

00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:07.350
I love you, Papa!

00:24:07.350 --> 00:24:08.890
It's a monster!
